{"seq":2,"slug":"mixed-lighting","title":"混合光源与白平衡挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/white-balance/mixed-lighting","wordCount":1620,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"混合光源与白平衡挑战\">混合光源与白平衡挑战</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>现实场景几乎不存在&quot;单一色温&quot;的照明——窗外的日光与室内的 LED、路灯与霓虹招牌、影棚中的主光与环境反射光，都在同一画面中制造<strong>多重色温共存</strong>的复杂局面。混合光源是白平衡最困难的场景：你无法让所有区域同时&quot;正确&quot;——选择校正一种光源意味着另一种会偏色。本文探讨混合光源的识别、处理策略和创意利用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Mixed Lighting&lt;br/&gt;混合光源&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Identify Sources&lt;br/&gt;识别光源&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Choose Strategy&lt;br/&gt;选择策略&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Post Processing&lt;br/&gt;后期处理&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;Ambient: Daylight&lt;br/&gt;环境:日光&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;Artificial: Tungsten&lt;br/&gt;人工:钨丝&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[&quot;Mixed: Fluorescent&lt;br/&gt;混合:荧光&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;Prioritize Subject&lt;br/&gt;优先主体&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;Gel Correction&lt;br/&gt;色片统一&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[&quot;Accept Mixed&lt;br/&gt;接受混合&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;Local WB&lt;br/&gt;局部白平衡&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;HSL Selective&lt;br/&gt;HSL选择性&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Mixed Lighting&lt;br/&gt;混合光源\"] --&gt; B[\"Identify Sources&lt;br/&gt;识别光源\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Choose Strategy&lt;br/&gt;选择策略\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Post Processing&lt;br/&gt;后期处理\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"Ambient: Daylight&lt;br/&gt;环境:日光\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"Artificial: Tungsten&lt;br/&gt;人工:钨丝\"]\n    B --&gt; B3[\"Mixed: Fluorescent&lt;br/&gt;混合:荧光\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"Prioritize Subject&lt;br/&gt;优先主体\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"Gel Correction&lt;br/&gt;色片统一\"]\n    C --&gt; C3[\"Accept Mixed&lt;br/&gt;接受混合\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"Local WB&lt;br/&gt;局部白平衡\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"HSL Selective&lt;br/&gt;HSL选择性\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>混合光源场景没有&quot;完美解&quot;，但有一套稳定的核心判断框架：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>混合光源 = 多重色温共存</strong>：同一画面中存在色温差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>1500</mn><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 1500K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的多种光源，校正一种必然使另一种偏色。</li>\n<li><strong>光谱不连续是根本障碍</strong>：荧光灯与低 CRI LED 的光谱为线状+宽带，其 CCT 虽可标为某值，但 SPD 与同温度黑体差异极大，纯色温校正无法消除残留色偏。</li>\n<li><strong>策略三选一</strong>：拍摄时用 Gel 统一光源、以主体主光为基准设 WB、或接受并利用混合色温本身作为叙事。</li>\n<li><strong>后期需局部化处理</strong>：局部白平衡（渐变/径向/笔刷）与 HSL 选择性校正，才能在 RAW 阶段分别修正不同区域。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"混合光源的类型\">混合光源的类型</h2><h3 id=\"常见混合场景\">常见混合场景</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>光源组合</th>\n<th>色温差异</th>\n<th>难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>窗边室内</td>\n<td>日光 (5500K) + 钨丝灯 (2700K)</td>\n<td>~2800K</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>办公室</td>\n<td>荧光灯 (4000K) + 窗光 (6500K)</td>\n<td>~2500K</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>餐厅</td>\n<td>暖LED (3000K) + 蜡烛 (1900K)</td>\n<td>~1100K</td>\n<td>低（同方向）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商业街</td>\n<td>日落 (3000K) + 霓虹 (各色)</td>\n<td>无法量化</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>演唱会</td>\n<td>色彩灯光 (全光谱)</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>特殊处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体育馆</td>\n<td>金卤灯 (5600K) + LED (5000K)</td>\n<td>~600K</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"光谱不连续的特殊挑战\">光谱不连续的特殊挑战</h3><p>荧光灯和某些 LED 的光谱是<strong>线状+宽带</strong>的组合——它们的 CCT 可以标为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4000</mn><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4000K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4000</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>，但光谱分布完全不同于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4000</mn><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4000K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4000</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的黑体。这意味着简单的色温校正无法完全消除色偏：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>spectral</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mtext>SPD</mtext><mtext>source</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>SPD</mtext><mtext>blackbody</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{spectral}} = \\int |\\text{SPD}_{\\text{source}}(\\lambda) - \\text{SPD}_{\\text{blackbody}}(\\lambda)| \\, d\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">spectral</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2222em;vertical-align:-0.8622em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SPD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">source</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SPD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">blackbody</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>光源</th>\n<th>光谱连续性</th>\n<th>白平衡难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>白炽灯/日光</td>\n<td>完美连续</td>\n<td>简单（纯色温校正）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高 CRI LED</td>\n<td>近似连续</td>\n<td>低（色温+微调 Tint）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>荧光灯</td>\n<td>线状光谱</td>\n<td>中（需色温+品红/绿调）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低 CRI LED</td>\n<td>蓝峰+窄带</td>\n<td>高（肤色难还原）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钠灯</td>\n<td>单色（589nm）</td>\n<td>几乎不可能还原</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"拍摄时的处理策略\">拍摄时的处理策略</h2><h3 id=\"策略一-色温片-gel-统一光源\">策略一：色温片（Gel）统一光源</h3><p>最专业的处理方式——用色温转换片（CTO/CTB）将不同光源统一到同一色温：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>色片</th>\n<th>转换</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Full CTO</td>\n<td>5500K → 2900K</td>\n<td>闪光灯模拟钨丝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1/2 CTO</td>\n<td>5500K → 3800K</td>\n<td>部分暖化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1/4 CTO</td>\n<td>5500K → 4500K</td>\n<td>轻微暖化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Full CTB</td>\n<td>2900K → 5500K</td>\n<td>钨丝灯模拟日光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plus Green</td>\n<td>去除荧光灯品红</td>\n<td>闪光灯匹配荧光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Minus Green</td>\n<td>加品红</td>\n<td>相机端抵消荧光绿</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"策略二-优先主体白平衡\">策略二：优先主体白平衡</h3><p>当无法统一光源时，<strong>以主体受到的主光为基准</strong>设置白平衡：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>WB</mtext><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>CCT</mtext><mtext>主体主光源</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{WB}_{target} = \\text{CCT}_{主体主光源}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">WB</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CCT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">主体主光源</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>主体光源</th>\n<th>WB 设定</th>\n<th>其他区域效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>窗边人像</td>\n<td>窗光 5500K</td>\n<td>5500K</td>\n<td>室内偏暖橙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>舞台表演</td>\n<td>追光灯 5600K</td>\n<td>5600K</td>\n<td>环境灯偏色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>咖啡厅人像</td>\n<td>LED 筒灯 3500K</td>\n<td>3500K</td>\n<td>窗外偏蓝</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"策略三-接受混合色温\">策略三：接受混合色温</h3><p>有时混合色温本身就是画面<strong>故事的一部分</strong>——不必追求&quot;全画面统一&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>创意混合</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>冷外+暖内</td>\n<td>家的温暖感</td>\n<td>外部蓝调+窗内暖黄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暖肤+冷环境</td>\n<td>主体突出</td>\n<td>闪光灯暖色+阴天背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多色霓虹</td>\n<td>城市活力</td>\n<td>街头多色光源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"后期处理方案\">后期处理方案</h2><h3 id=\"局部白平衡调整\">局部白平衡调整</h3><p>RAW 处理软件允许对画面不同区域应用不同的白平衡：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>软件</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>渐变滤镜</td>\n<td>Lightroom/ACR</td>\n<td>对窗光区域单独调温</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>径向滤镜</td>\n<td>Lightroom/ACR</td>\n<td>对主体圆形区域调温</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>笔刷/蒙版</td>\n<td>Lightroom/Photoshop</td>\n<td>精确绘制区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 主体蒙版</td>\n<td>Lightroom 2025+</td>\n<td>自动识别主体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色相范围蒙版</td>\n<td>DaVinci Resolve</td>\n<td>按颜色选区调温</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"hsl-选择性校正\">HSL 选择性校正</h3><p>通过 HSL（色相/饱和度/明度）面板选择性调整特定颜色区域：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>目标</mtext><mo>:</mo><msub><mtext>钨丝灯偏暖区域</mtext><mtext>橙色</mtext></msub><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>HSL</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>中性化</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{目标}: \\text{钨丝灯偏暖区域}_{橙色} \\xrightarrow{\\text{HSL}} \\text{中性化}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2503em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">钨丝灯偏暖区域</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">橙色</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">HSL</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">中性化</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>注意</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>橙色色相→偏黄</td>\n<td>减轻钨丝暖偏</td>\n<td>不影响蓝色区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>橙色饱和度↓</td>\n<td>减弱暖色强度</td>\n<td>可能影响肤色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蓝色色相→偏青</td>\n<td>校正阴影冷偏</td>\n<td>保持天空自然</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自动白平衡-awb-的工作原理\">自动白平衡（AWB）的工作原理</h2><h3 id=\"awb-算法类型\">AWB 算法类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>灰色世界假设</td>\n<td>场景平均 = 灰色</td>\n<td>简单快速</td>\n<td>大面积单色失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>白点检测</td>\n<td>找最亮点作为白色参考</td>\n<td>高光准确</td>\n<td>高光过曝失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色温估计</td>\n<td>统计推断场景色温</td>\n<td>稳定</td>\n<td>混合光源困难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习型（AI）</td>\n<td>神经网络训练</td>\n<td>复杂场景准确</td>\n<td>需大量数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"awb-在混合光源下的表现\">AWB 在混合光源下的表现</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>AWB</mtext><mtext>混合</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>加权折中</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AWB}_{混合} = w_1 \\cdot T_1 + w_2 \\cdot T_2 + ... = \\text{加权折中}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AWB</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">混合</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">加权折中</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>AWB 在混合光源下通常选择一个<strong>折中色温</strong>——两种光源都不完全正确，但也不极端偏色。2025-2026 年旗舰相机的 AI AWB 已能识别光源类型并做区域化处理：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>相机/系统</th>\n<th>AWB 特性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Sony A7R V</td>\n<td>AI 人脸优先 AWB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Canon R5 II</td>\n<td>光源类型识别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iPhone 16 Pro</td>\n<td>语义分割区域 AWB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nikon Z8</td>\n<td>自然光优先模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实战案例\">实战案例</h2><h3 id=\"案例-室内窗光-灯光人像\">案例：室内窗光+灯光人像</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;Window Light&lt;br/&gt;窗光 5500K&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Subject&lt;br/&gt;主体&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;LED Light&lt;br/&gt;室内灯 3000K&quot;] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;Camera WB Decision&lt;br/&gt;白平衡决策&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E1[&quot;WB=5500K&lt;br/&gt;室内偏暖橙&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E2[&quot;WB=4000K&lt;br/&gt;折中(两边都略偏)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E3[&quot;WB=3000K&lt;br/&gt;窗光偏冷蓝&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"Window Light&lt;br/&gt;窗光 5500K\"] --&gt; B[\"Subject&lt;br/&gt;主体\"]\n    C[\"LED Light&lt;br/&gt;室内灯 3000K\"] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; D[\"Camera WB Decision&lt;br/&gt;白平衡决策\"]\n    D --&gt; E1[\"WB=5500K&lt;br/&gt;室内偏暖橙\"]\n    D --&gt; E2[\"WB=4000K&lt;br/&gt;折中(两边都略偏)\"]\n    D --&gt; E3[\"WB=3000K&lt;br/&gt;窗光偏冷蓝\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>主体效果</th>\n<th>环境效果</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>匹配窗光 (5500K)</td>\n<td>肤色自然</td>\n<td>室内暖橙氛围</td>\n<td>自然光人像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折中 (4000K)</td>\n<td>微暖</td>\n<td>窗偏冷+灯偏暖</td>\n<td>纪实/不后期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>匹配灯光 (3000K)</td>\n<td>肤色偏冷</td>\n<td>窗外极蓝</td>\n<td>特殊效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>闪光灯+CTO</td>\n<td>可控</td>\n<td>可控</td>\n<td>专业布光</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>混合光源是白平衡的终极挑战——没有&quot;完美解&quot;只有&quot;最佳折中&quot;。核心决策流程：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>行动</th>\n<th>关键判断</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>识别</td>\n<td>找出画面中所有光源及其色温</td>\n<td>色温差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1500</mn><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 1500K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> = 需处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级</td>\n<td>确定最重要的区域</td>\n<td>通常是人脸/主体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拍摄</td>\n<td>Gel 统一 / AWB / 手动选择</td>\n<td>能统一就统一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后期</td>\n<td>局部调整 / HSL / AI 蒙版</td>\n<td>RAW 格式是前提</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创意</td>\n<td>是否利用混合色温作为叙事</td>\n<td>暖冷对比可能是加分项</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"混合光源与白平衡挑战","id":"混合光源与白平衡挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"混合光源的类型","id":"混合光源的类型"},{"level":3,"text":"常见混合场景","id":"常见混合场景"},{"level":3,"text":"光谱不连续的特殊挑战","id":"光谱不连续的特殊挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"拍摄时的处理策略","id":"拍摄时的处理策略"},{"level":3,"text":"策略一：色温片（Gel）统一光源","id":"策略一-色温片-gel-统一光源"},{"level":3,"text":"策略二：优先主体白平衡","id":"策略二-优先主体白平衡"},{"level":3,"text":"策略三：接受混合色温","id":"策略三-接受混合色温"},{"level":2,"text":"后期处理方案","id":"后期处理方案"},{"level":3,"text":"局部白平衡调整","id":"局部白平衡调整"},{"level":3,"text":"HSL 选择性校正","id":"hsl-选择性校正"},{"level":2,"text":"自动白平衡（AWB）的工作原理","id":"自动白平衡-awb-的工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"AWB 算法类型","id":"awb-算法类型"},{"level":3,"text":"AWB 在混合光源下的表现","id":"awb-在混合光源下的表现"},{"level":2,"text":"实战案例","id":"实战案例"},{"level":3,"text":"案例：室内窗光+灯光人像","id":"案例-室内窗光-灯光人像"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"色温与光源特性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/white-balance/color-temperature"},"next":{"title":"创意白平衡与色调设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/white-balance/creative-white-balance"}}